A||||16||FieroHarry||July 14th Kitty Hawk meet!||||6||
Z||000000||FieroHarry||06-02-2001||11:30 AM||||Okay everybody,<BR>Bring your sun glasses,tanning lotion,coolers and chairs.<BR>The NC and VA Fiero club members are having a imprompt get together at the Wright brothers Memorial in Kitty Hawk NC. <BR>We will meet at 1PM (1300hrs for the military minded members  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)<P>This will be a good chance for us to all get together without having to prep for a show  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> and just talk Fieros  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">  plus show off our latest mods.<BR>From the Wright memorial we will mass drive to dinner.<P>Please note: this "is not a show" (like that would stop you from having your cars look sharp) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>Further info as to dinner and possible cruise to come.<P>------------------<BR><B>Harry Waggoner</B><BR>1985 GT 264K+ <I>FOCOSEVA,FOCOA</I><BR><B>"Im not driving to fast, Im flying to low!"</B><p>[This message has been edited by FieroHarry (edited 06-02-2001).]||||reg||6
