Z||000013||FieroHarry||06-04-2001||08:30 AM||||Mark or anyone else for that matter,<P>You are more than welcome to come and join in!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Being part of NC or VA Fiero's is not needed to participate.<P>This is something we started here on the forum (non-club function) and it expanded out far enough for the club members to want to drive en-mass.<P>Any and all Forum members and there co-pilots are welcome to come! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>------------------<BR><B>Harry Waggoner</B><BR>1985 GT 264K+ <I>FOCOSEVA,FOCOA</I><BR><B>"Im not driving to fast, Im flying to low!"</B>||||reg||1
